WEBVTT

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.480
You're going to ram the 
Star Rose into the gate?!

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:05.310
That's right.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.380
But that's...

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.320
Captain Amane, issue the orders!

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.990
All fleets, concentrate on 
defending the Star Rose!

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:15.530
You can't be serious...!

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.260
Commander Simon!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.080
I expect the Godinion to 
follow that order as well.

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:21.540
Get moving!

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:24.480
Yes, sir.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.780
Daneel, we shall stand before it.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:46.580
I'm counting on you, Princess!

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:55.520
"Flowers Falling in Space"

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:53.930
Don't tell me

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:55.930
they're gonna bash the Star Rose into the gate!

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.050
If they do, Commander Simon will...!

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:58.910
Captain!

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:02.170
The purpose of this mission 
is to destroy the gate.

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:04.540
That is why all of us have 
gone through such lengths.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:06.790
Isn't there some other way?

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.710
Commander Simon has 
chosen the best option

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.370
that is within our current capacity.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:13.910
This is currently our best... option?

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:17.990
Make sure to do your utmost 
to protect the Star Rose.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:19.830
If it's destroyed before 
it hits the gate,

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:21.640
the Commander's resolve 
will have been for naught!

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:26.560
I will put everything I have 
into defending the Star Rose!

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:27.770
Let's go!

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.840
Absurd!

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.780
Do they mean to crash 
that into the gate?

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:59.300
Prince Jiart! Prince Jiart!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.690
Please retreat for now!

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.110
An enemy ship is about 
to crash into the gate!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:13.340
Prince Jiart!

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.170
You're a nuisance!

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.760
Right now, I merely wish to hunt!

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.150
I want to hunt you!

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:24.150
Fight! Fight!

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:26.410
They're calling!

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:27.810
My instincts are calling out to me!

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:32.610
Fight! Fight... Fight...

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.550
Is it awakening?

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.500
Is it bringing out the 
beast inside of me?

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.720
No! I want to protect them!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:40.930
To protect everyone...!

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:44.830
Fight... Fight... Fight...

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.040
FIGHT!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.470
That's right!

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.740
I am sure you must understand... ME!

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:32.630
All fleets, enter an 
oblique battle formation!

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:34.810
Protect the Star Rose at all costs!

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:41.720
65% of enemy forces have 
concentrated on the AHSMB units.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.370
35% are currently 
approaching the Star Rose.

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:48.060
All enemies from Quadrants 
D to E are fast upon us!

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:51.230
Suruga, concentrate fire 
in the EE-8 direction.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.810
Asagi, you take DD-7!

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.000
Tamaki, charge in the EA-5 direction!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.230
Roger!

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.710
I'm outta ammo again!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:09.290
You've already burned 
through everything, Stupid?

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.910
I'll load her back up in a jiff, Stupid!

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:11.430
Stupid!

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:12.640
Jeez!

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.170
The charged particle cannon-!

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.780
Bros, please prep a heavy laser!

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.240
He called us, "Bros"!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.100
Okay! Hurry back on the double!

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:26.200
We'll be waiting!

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.870
Blue 1 has too much stress 
on its elbow joints!

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:31.430
I don't mean the units, 
but the actual people!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:32.850
Make them relax!

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:33.940
Roger!

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.400
Purple 2 has exceeded the 
limit of reparability.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.880
Reduce irrelevant information 
and distribute the proshesses.

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:42.320
What did she just say?

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:43.570
She meant, "Distribute the processes."

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:45.590
Boss, you aren't drunk, are you?

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.470
Nah, she's just been talking non-stop.

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:50.970
When this is over, I'm gonna drink 
till I drop, so pick up the tab!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.390
You can have a whole keg!

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:57.170
And here it's completely over-heated...

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:59.670
How come it's still 
able to move like that?

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.050
The amazing feats

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:02.260
accomplished by an AHSMB unit

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:03.520
unit when at its limits!

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:05.780
Are you going to start 
reciting them all?

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:12.870
Prey! I must defeat my prey!

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:23.300
Fear? I am afraid...?

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:27.630
I see... Fascinating!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.010
The way I am moving, it feels like 
I’ve become one with Red 5.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:40.610
No, am I the one being moved?

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:46.490
It's moving me to fight... 
To protect itself...

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:49.870
No! I'M the one out here fighting!

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:51.410
Fight!

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:52.790
FIGHT!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:00.380
Red 5, that is enough! Red 5?

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.860
Your body can't handle any more combat!

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:05.320
The captain...

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.320
Don't run away!

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:08.430
No, I'm not!

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:09.910
I've got to go back!

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.100
Fight! Fight... Fight...

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:13.330
I can't!

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:14.910
Fight! Fight...! Fight...!

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.460
I CAN'T!

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.580
FIGHT!

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.280
It hurts! I can't breathe!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.030
My body won't move!

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.470
Despite all of that, I 
still want to fight...

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.240
...until my life burns out!

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:39.980
Red 5! Red 5, come in!

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:41.210
Red 5!

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:45.170
Izuru... Is something going on?

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.690
Tamaki, Suruga, hurry 
back to the battlefield!

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:50.600
Requesting emergency support fire!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:53.240
Kei, please bring Izuru back!

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:53.760
Huh?

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.950
If this keeps up, he's going 
to keep fighting even

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.600
after the Star Rose hits the gate!

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.520
And at this rate, he'll...

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:02.890
Please go.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.690
You really are his big brother, Asagi.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.220
Suruga, please cover Kei.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:11.280
Sure thing!

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:14.600
Ya gotta wait to get a good shot,

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.430
but if all you do is wait, you'll 
never hit your prey, huh?

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:18.500
That's the ultimate truth.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.250
And me? What about me?

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:22.770
Tamaki, please offer 
the Star Rose backup!

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:23.960
Okey-dokey!

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.380
Guys, please handle things here!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.820
Miss, go!

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.200
Be sure to win him over!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.140
She's supposed to be fighting the enemy.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:48.510
You can do it, Blue No.1!

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:49.330
He's Blue 1.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.740
What?!

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:00.000
Did you finish restocking your supplies?

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.000
I'm here because I'm done!

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:06.380
Hey! Are you trying to kill me?!

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.120
You're in my way!

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.670
Don't stand in front of me!

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.700
How do you get off throwing your 
weight around after a late entry?!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.550
Shut up and follow me!

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.550
Reining in a bucking bronco isn't easy!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:42.710
Red 5!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:44.500
Red 5!

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.420
Izuru, can't you hear me?

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:47.670
Izuru!

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.180
Someone's calling for me...?

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:51.630
Fight! Fight...! Fight...!

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:53.840
I...

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.360
...will fight!

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:56.720
Izuru!

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:59.800
Come back! You don't have to fight.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:03.360
Come back to us alive. 
Everyone is waiting for you!

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.960
We're waiting for you to 
come back to us alive!

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:06.810
Shut up!

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:07.590
Listen to me!

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:08.460
Off my back! Listen to me!

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:09.980
This isn't like you, Izuru!

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.560
Weren't you going to become a hero?

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:15.080
Weren't you going to 
become a hero with us?!

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:16.860
A hero...?

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.890
Hey, you'd better listen to her!

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.050
Kei is doing her best to 
talk some sense into you,

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.370
even though she hates talking!

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.980
Stoopy-poopy-doopy head!

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:27.370
You've got way too determined of a 
look on your face for our derpy Izuru!

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.590
A combo-jab...?

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.610
You're making us want to jab at you!

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:33.600
And here we kept telling you 
not to come out and fight!

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:35.240
Space case! Nincompoop!

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:37.720
You're not only short on ammo,
but you're also missing a pair of balls!

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:39.240
You're horrible.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:40.580
You're the one who's horrible!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.180
That manga you draw is horrible, too!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.430
You really are a failure!

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.440
Could you quit hitting me 
with the three-combo jabs?

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:54.150
Izuru...! You came back!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:55.990
Thank goodness!

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:58.280
Don't let your AHSMB 
take over you again.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.910
You see, humans are more about 
worldly desires than instinct!

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:02.870
Thank you, guys!

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:13.180
Red 5, retreat!

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.050
Roger!

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:18.820
I won't let you escape!

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:32.020
Forget it! I am not yet satisfied!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:37.280
Izuru!

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:41.370
Wherever you go, I shall 
follow in pursuit!

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:46.530
That's right!

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:50.790
That's enough! Stop fighting already!

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.340
Move it! Do not interfere!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:56.260
Kei!

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.170
Miss!

00:10:58.610 --> 00:10:59.940
Purple 2 has taken damage!

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.590
Stop it!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:06.410
Purple 2's damage reading is at 25%!

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.070
There are no irregularities in 
the pilot's vitality readings.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:11.550
Where's Star Rose?

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:13.020
Remaining distance to the gate: 400.

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:17.550
He's almost there...

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.140
Kei!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.980
Kei, hang in there!

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.100
Damn it!

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.150
What the hell are you guys doing?!

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:36.840
Hurry over to Red 5 and Purple 2!

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:40.050
Ange! Chandra...!

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.380
Please go!

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:44.090
I wasn't able to save 
my friends, but you...

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.990
Quit spacin' out!

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:49.170
Go crush that Wulgaru bastard 
named Desert, Gelato,

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:51.990
Tomato, Potato or whatever!

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:54.100
Dang! None of those were right.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:55.690
You've got it!

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.340
I'm off!

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.870
Wait! Hey, wait up!

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:10.200
Izuru!

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:23.860
Guys!

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:25.070
We're pulling back!

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.030
Hurry!

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:27.510
Kei, are you all right?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.330
You all came...!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.000
Kei, I wanna eat your 
cake again sometime!

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:33.440
Really?

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.100
Well...

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.660
Guys, head on back-

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.410
Look after Kei!

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:51.280
At this rate, he's going 
to take everyone down.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.830
But I don't want to die...

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.050
I don't want to die here.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:02.970
Survive...

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:04.970
I will survive!

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:09.300
But I'm not surviving 
just for my own sake.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:12.870
There are those whom I want to protect!

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:17.310
I'm not fighting because 
I want to fight.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.980
I'm doing it to protect 
those who are dear to me!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:21.670
And because...

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.110
I want to become a hero!

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:25.860
That's what it boils down to?!

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:44.860
What is that?

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:46.090
What's going on?

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:47.890
What does that imply?

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.950
Does it mean that Red 5 
has taken over the pilot?

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:53.660
No! It's probably the exact opposite.

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:56.210
Izuru has truly mastered Red 5!

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:59.230
This is the JURIA-System's 
ultimate form.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.610
Is that its true awakening?

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:03.050
That's right.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.760
It transformed!

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:05.970
You mean its "frame changed".

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:18.250
Marvelous! I shall respond in suit!

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:01.880
Remaining distance to the gate: 100!

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.090
Withdraw, Team Rabbits!

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:05.840
All armies, retreat!

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.570
Pull back, Kei, Tamaki and Suruga!

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:13.850
What about Izuru?

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:17.470
He will survive.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:22.190
That's how the JURIA-System 
works, right?

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:27.070
Lady Teoria, please hurry!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.400
Lady Teoria...?

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:32.550
I want you to go back.

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:36.470
I will see this through to the end!

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.520
Then so shall I.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.790
I swear that we will stop you!

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:46.400
One minute until collision.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.640
Izuru, hurry! Please!

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.510
Commander Simon...

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:07.800
Dad...

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:10.800
Red 5, retreat!

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.360
Red 5!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.330
Izuru, come back!

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.120
What's keeping you?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:22.830
It's about to ram into the gate!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:24.080
Izuru!

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:31.260
Commander Simon, please abandon ship!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.690
Now that it has come to this...!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:40.080
Legatus Dolgana, please retreat!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.350
There is no turning back!

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.000
Please wait here!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:47.930
Daneel!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:55.990
Lemme handle these pests!

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:01.370
Bite the dust, ya nasty ground beetles!

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.810
I'm not done yet!

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:29.270
All armies, retreat! Pull back 
before the gate implodes!

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.860
Don't pursue the 
retreating enemy fleets!

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:44.280
To live and die in accordance 
to one's instincts...

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:48.730
In a sense, that is the ultimate way 
for any creature to live its life.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:52.300
May you fare well, Princess Teoria.

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.170
Ten seconds until collision!

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:55.200
Stupid!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:55.490
Izuru!
Stupid!

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:55.740
Come back!
 Izuru!
 Stupid!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:56.240
Come back!
 What's keepin' ya?!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:01.400
5,

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:02.620
4,

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:03.750
3,

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:04.800
2,

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:05.910
1,

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:06.560
0.

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:12.080
Star Rose Galaxy Rest Area

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:23.410
Izuru!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.540
The gate is starting to collapse.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.690
The operation was a success.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:06.120
This is the moment I 
have been waiting for!

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.130
I'm not finished yet!

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:40.030
The time to hunt you down is now!

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:44.910
I will survive and return to my friends!

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:04.300
We can still achieve heights 
far greater than this!

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:23.320
They destroyed our gate?

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.260
I am terribly sorry.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:29.250
At long last, we have found it.

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.180
The gate may have closed,

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:35.790
but a new evolutionary 
path has opened before us.

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.640
There are heat signatures coming 
from the direction of the gate!

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.570
Confirming their ID codes!

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:56.860
They're Teoria and Daneel's units!

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:59.530
I am sorry.

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:01.740
I had a hard time convincing 
him to abandon ship.

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:07.070
Thank you, Princess.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.730
I've failed to die yet again, Juria.

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:23.320
And I have lost everything.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:24.370
However,

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:28.080
a new hero has been born.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:33.770
Where is Red 5... Izuru?

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:36.840
I'm not getting any 
readings on my monitor!

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.520
Guiliano! Siegfried!

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:42.240
Maximize our broad sensor's 
output and find him!

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:42.940
Roger!

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:45.400
Maximizing broad sensor output!

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:48.550
Izuru...!

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:50.500
Izuru!

00:22:25.930 --> 00:22:28.570
I'm picking something 
up in Sector AE-23!

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:31.140
I've confirmed that it's Red 5! 
I'm sending you the coordinates!

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:35.410
Izuru!

00:22:35.850 --> 00:22:36.660
Izuru!

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:37.920
Izuru!

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:39.170
Officer Izuru!

00:22:39.560 --> 00:22:40.480
Izuru!

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:41.980
Izuru!

00:22:44.390 --> 00:22:45.590
Izuru...

00:22:58.210 --> 00:22:59.550
He pulled through!

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:09.390
Izuru!

00:23:09.390 --> 00:23:10.680
Izuru! Izuru!

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:12.680
Izuru!

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:15.770
Izuru...!
